comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T18:15:23.981Z",codex-root,Implementation scope is the exact tagged Core contract; arbitrary integration-specific WebSocket commands remain available through hassio ws call and are not reimplemented here.
  "2026-08-07T18:28:30.851Z",codex-root,"Core 2026.8.1 source inspection identified composite split topology, linked-device discovery, global entity-ID settings, and the previously untyped automatic-ID preview. Normalized CLI envelopes retain provenance, deterministic ordering, count, returned_count, and truncation where applicable."
  "2026-08-07T18:36:48.491Z",codex-root,"Upstream PM core issue filed after four all-state searches: unbraind/pm-cli#930 documents pm duplicates --status all silently scanning zero items. The canonical duplicate check used the safe unfiltered command, which scanned all 85 items and found zero clusters."
  "2026-08-07T18:46:59.639Z",codex-root,"CodeRabbit review verified against tagged Core 2026.8.1: adopted exact entity-ID validation, including domain-only consecutive-underscore rejection; aligned the 2026.8.1 docs boundary; and enriched canonical Feature/Plan evidence."
notes[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T18:15:23.981Z",codex-root,"The live server predates these contracts. Expected live outcome is structured unknown_command, not fabricated success or a fallback that changes semantics."
  "2026-08-07T18:28:31.361Z",codex-root,Read-only live E2E passed against Core 2026.7.4. automatic-entity-ids succeeds; composite-splits and entity-id-settings return unknown_command and are classified as version availability rather than converted into empty data.
  "2026-08-07T18:40:14.736Z",codex-root,"Automatic daily release evidence: the latest scheduled hosted run succeeded with no_changes_since_last_tag at v2026.8.6, and the clean local conditional dry-run completed for v2026.8.7 without pushing or tagging."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T18:15:23.981Z",codex-root,"Entity-ID settings accept null or a unique ordered subset of floor, area, device, entity that must contain device and entity."
